      895   end.
      896   on alt-shift-f3 anywhere do:
      897     run proc-alt-shift-f3 in this-procedure .
      898   end.
      899   on alt-shift-f4 anywhere do:
      900     run proc-alt-shift-f4 in this-procedure.
      901   end.
      902   on alt-f1 anywhere do:
      903     run proc-alt-f1 in this-procedure .
      904   end.
